# The Gobbiebag Part I (jeuno 27): Lower Jeuno's Bluffnix (no script; default 43 with 81), the template GobbiebagQuest.
# A level 75 Warrior at Jeuno fame level 1, the inventory at 30 (a fresh char), the four items, a Bowl of Goblin Stew
# (880) and a Chocobo Feather. Available: a trade: no trade handler; 43 (31, 0, 1), option 1: nothing; option 0: begun.
# Accepted: 43 (31, 1, 1), its finish: no handler; three items, the four and the feather, the stew and an item: 43 (31,
# 1, 1); the stew alone: 73 (36), the quest completed by a GM while it is open: no 73 finish (the stew kept); accepted
# again (a GM): the four items: 73 (36), finished: completed, the inventory 35, INVENTORY_INCREASED, the items taken (no
# satchel: unchanged). Completed: Part II's 43 (36, 0, 1) (its fame level 1 met, the inventory 35, Part I completed),
# declined (option 1). Set accepted by a GM at 35: the accepted check fails: no section (43 (81)), a trade: nothing; set
# available by a GM at 35: no section. A GM sets a part available before accepted (accepted over completed keeps it
# completed).
lists LowerJeuno/Bluffnix/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Bluffnix/onTrade LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/43 LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/73
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-41.7,5.9,-113 job=WAR lvl=75
item SquareOfDhalmelLeather
item SteelIngot
item SquareOfLinenCloth
item Peridot
item BowlOfGoblinStew880
item ChocoboFeather
login
trade Bluffnix ChocoboFeather x1        # available: no trade handler; nothing
trigger Bluffnix                        # reqsMet: 43 (31, 0, 1)
finish option=1                         # not 0: nothing
trigger Bluffnix                        # 43 (31, 0, 1)
finish option=0                         # begun
trigger Bluffnix                        # accepted: 43 (31, 1, 1)
finish option=0                         # no 43 finish while accepted: nothing
trade Bluffnix SquareOfDhalmelLeather x1 SteelIngot x1 SquareOfLinenCloth x1 # three of the four: 43 (31, 1, 1)
finish
trade Bluffnix SquareOfDhalmelLeather x1 SteelIngot x1 SquareOfLinenCloth x1 Peridot x1 ChocoboFeather x1 # an extra item: 43 (31, 1, 1)
finish
trade Bluffnix BowlOfGoblinStew880 x1 SquareOfDhalmelLeather x1 # the stew and an item: 43 (31, 1, 1)
finish
trade Bluffnix BowlOfGoblinStew880 x1   # the stew alone: 73 (36)
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartI completed # a GM, while 73 is open
finish                                  # no 73 finish while completed: nothing (the stew kept)
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartI available # a GM: accepted over completed keeps it completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartI accepted  # a GM
trade Bluffnix SquareOfDhalmelLeather x1 SteelIngot x1 SquareOfLinenCloth x1 Peridot x1 # the four items: 73 (36)
finish                                  # completed; inventory 35; INVENTORY_INCREASED; the items taken
trigger Bluffnix                        # completed: Part II's 43 (36, 0, 1)
finish option=1                         # declined: nothing
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartI available # a GM: accepted over completed keeps it completed
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartI accepted  # a GM, at 35
trigger Bluffnix                        # accepted, the inventory 35: no section; 43 (81)
finish
trade Bluffnix BowlOfGoblinStew880 x1   # no section: nothing
quest Jeuno.TheGobbiebagPartI available # a GM, at 35
trigger Bluffnix                        # available, the inventory 35: no section; 43 (81)
finish option=0                         # no section: not begun
